  "title": "Colombia’s President Faces Criticism for Power Outages, Blames 'Terrorist Attacks'",
  "summary": "Colombia’s new president, Abelardo De La Espriella, faces criticism for power outages, which have followed a string of violent armed group attacks attributed to Colombia’s traffickers. The president claims that the power outages are a result of the ongoing conflict and a response to the groups’ actions.",
